# frontend/'s middleware used to 308-redirect /docs/* to docs.mcp.aevrin.net
# from this same domain (DECISIONS.md ADR-009); this app has no middleware
# to do that, so an old /docs bookmark on the root domain would otherwise
# 404 instead. Cloudflare's own static-redirect mechanism for exactly this.
/docs https://docs.mcp.aevrin.net/ 308
/docs/* https://docs.mcp.aevrin.net/:splat 308
